qmltermwidget-taris

QMLTermWidget (https://github.com/Swordfish90/qmltermwidget, commit ce8e09a), by Swordfish90 and
the QTermWidget and Konsole authors. It's licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2
or later; some of its files are under the GNU Library or Lesser General Public License version 2
or 2.1 or later, or the BSD 3-clause licence, as their headers say (LICENSE, LICENSE.LGPL2+,
LICENSE.BSD-3-clause and COPYING-CMAKE-SCRIPTS, next to this file).

Changed by TarisOS (https://github.com/TarisOS/tarisOS) in 2026, in taris.patch:

- At most about 30 screen updates a second.
- A full repaint when the terminal is put in a window or shown again.
- Colour schemes also read from each account's $XDG_STATE_HOME/taris/terminal.
- Wheel scrolling by the distance moved, in the scrollback and in programs that read the mouse.

Every file it changes says so at its top (taris-notices.patch). Both patches are in TarisOS's
source, packaging/pkgbuilds/qmltermwidget-taris.
